//RS /// D-META-AUTO1=A / D-AUTODERIVE-SYNTAX1=D: `!` refuses any built-in
//RS /// capability that the structural auto-derive engine can provide. Keep this
//RS /// vocabulary in the owner-controlled Syntax surface so the parser, type
